{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"んっちゃぁぁおりゃぁぁ！とっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アミッキー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、名古屋個別あくちゅかい❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶりんらぶりん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみと短い時間づつだがデート気分味わおうne～)^o^("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の全握の時は手羽先食べ損ねたからなぁ...今回こそは...。。くっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風来坊？？いただきたいしだいだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、ずーさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーさんはうまいこと手羽先食べれるのかな...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手羽先って正しい食べ方みたいなのあるんでしょ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の人教えてぇやぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまいことトゥルンッ♪っていくのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ねぇ、ちーちゃんが愛未のことを悟りを開いてるような目で見てくるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三日月風味って感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかその目で見られるとねぇ、なんか嘘とか全部見抜かれてる感じがするの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな目か気になる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、気になる方は明日あみが再現...といいたいとこだけどやっぱちーちゃんにやってもらってください。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしには...出来ない...。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/13/4814248/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく明日は楽しもうね  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"}],"source":"archive"}